<title>UK: John Wile appointed West Brom chief exec.</title>
<headline>John Wile appointed West Brom chief exec.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>English first division soccer club West Bromwich Albion Plc said on Tuesday that former club captain John Wile had been appointed group chief executive.</p>
<p>Wile, a central defender who made over 700 first team appearances for West Brom in the 1970s and early 80s, joins the company from a unit of GEC, where he was national sales manager.</p>
<p>West Brom joined the Alternative Investment Market in January.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
